## 8. Conclusion

The Interactive Sales Analysis Dashboard demonstrates how Excel can be used to transform raw sales data into a structured business reporting solution.

By combining interactive city filtering with regional, product, shipping, state, and category-level analysis, the dashboard provides a comprehensive view of sales performance. The project also demonstrates practical knowledge of Excel-based data analysis and dashboard development, making it suitable as a **Data Analyst portfolio project**.
